<title>NETHERLANDS: Esso confirms Rotterdam refinery running smoothly.</title>
<headline>Esso confirms Rotterdam refinery running smoothly.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exxon Corp's Esso Netherlands confirmed on Monday its Rotterdam refinery was running as normal after the small &quot;hiccup&quot; at its flexi-coker unit on Friday morning.</p>
<p>&quot;Everything is running fine. There are no problems,&quot; a spokesman said.</p>
<p>On Friday, traders said Esso offered fuel oil as low as $108 fob ARA per tonne, some $7 below Thursday's closing level because of the problems.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
